\"Chip is a Kotlin extension of this catalog, not an official shadcn/ui component. shadcn only ships Badge, which is a static label, so there is no Base UI reference page or upstream recipe list to mirror. The API below is the current Kotlin source of truth: a selectable tag built from the same tokens as Button/Badge.\"\n- heading \"Selectable\":\n  - text: Selectable\n  - button\n- button\n- text: Pass selected and toggle it from onClick; the default variant follows the selection state.\n- button \"Kotlin\"\n- text: \"1 2 var selected by remember { mutableStateOf(false) } Chip(label = \\\"Kotlin\\\", selected = selected, onClick = { selected = !selected })\"\n- button \"View Code\"\n- heading \"Selected\":\n  - text: Selected\n  - button\n- button\n- text: Pin the selected look with ChipVariant.Selected.\n- button \"Kotlin\"\n- text: \"1 Chip(label = \\\"Kotlin\\\", variant = ChipVariant.Selected, onClick = {})\"\n- button \"View Code\"\n- heading \"Outline\":\n  - text: Outline\n  - button\n- button\n- text: Border-only treatment with ChipVariant.Outline.\n- button \"Outline\"\n- text: \"1 Chip(label = \\\"Outline\\\", variant = ChipVariant.Outline, onClick = {})\"\n- button \"View Code\"\n- heading \"Disabled\":\n  - text: Disabled\n  - button\n- button\n- text: disabled (or enabled = false) removes the click handler and dims the tag.\n- button \"Disabled\"\n- text: \"1 Chip(label = \\\"Disabled\\\", onClick = {}, disabled = true)\"\n- button \"View Code\"\n- heading \"Icon\":\n  - text: Icon\n  - button\n- button\n- text: The optional leadingIcon slot receives its size modifier and inherits the variant content color.\n- button \"Verified\"\n- text: \"1 2 3 Chip( label = \\\"Verified\\\", onClick = {},\"\n- button \"View Code\"\n- heading \"Row\":\n  - text: Row\n  - button\n- button\n- text: Chips compose in a row for filter groups.\n- button \"Kotlin\"\n- button \"Compose\"\n- button \"Multiplatform\"\n- text: \"1 2 3 Row(horizontalArrangement = Arrangement.spacedBy(8.dp)) { Chip(label = \\\"Kotlin\\\", selected = true, onClick = {}) Chip(label = \\\"Compose\\\", onClick = {})\"\n- button \"View Code\"\n- heading \"API Reference\":\n  - text: API Reference\n  - button\n- button\n- heading \"Chip\":\n  - text: Chip\n  - button\n- button\n- text: Selectable tag. Invoke with a label; the default variant is Selected when selected = true, otherwise Default. Property Type Default label String Required onClick (() -> Unit)? null (static tag when omitted) selected Boolean false variant ChipVariant Selected when selected, else Default enabled / disabled Boolean true / false leadingIcon (@Composable (Modifier) -> Unit)? null animation ButtonAnimation ButtonAnimation.Scale modifier / style Modifier / Style Default\n- heading \"ChipVariant\":\n  - text: ChipVariant\n  - button\n- button\n- text: \"Content colors: Default uses secondaryForeground, Selected uses primaryForeground, Outline uses foreground. Property Type Default Default ChipVariant Secondary fill with a border Selected ChipVariant Primary fill Outline ChipVariant Transparent with a border On This Page\"\n- button \"Installation\"\n- button \"Usage\"\n- button \"Composition\"\n- button \"Kotlin extension\"\n- button \"Selectable\"\n- button \"Selected\"\n- button \"Outline\"\n- button \"Disabled\"\n- button \"Icon\"\n- button \"Row\"\n- button \"API Reference\"\n- button \"Chip\"\n- button \"ChipVariant\""
